  "text": "Branch\nChoose branch\nAll restaurant · overview\nGarden House Flow QA — Main Branch · MAIN\nOrders, tables, inventory and devices belong to this branch.\nDAILY\nToday\nOrders\nMenu\nCustomers & loyalty\nDevices & sync\nOPERATIONS\nKIOSK MANAGEMENT\nKiosk Terminals\nCustomer experience\nKiosk Combos & Deals\nKiosk payment settings\nKiosk feedback\nQR ORDERING\nREPORTS\nSETUP\nEOD Report\nReconciliation\nAssistant\nLog out\nKiosk Terminal Control\n\nManage self-ordering stations, lockdown states, and maintenance modes.\n\nKiosk management is ready\n\nYou can manage kiosks here with your existing admin login. No extra Kiosk Admin activation key is needed.\n\nManage welcome screens\n1. Get a kiosk key\n\nA key connects one customer-facing kiosk to Garden House Flow QA — Main Branch. Your plan and device limits still apply.\n\nUnlike other JAMANVAAR apps, a kiosk key isn't issued instantly — a JAMANVAAR team member reviews each request and issues the key by hand. You'll see it update to \"Being worked on\" here, and we'll notify you once it's ready.\n\nRequest activation keyI already have a key\n2. Enter it on the kiosk\n\nOn the touchscreen device, open the JAMANVAAR Customer Kiosk app. On Activate Your Kiosk, enter your Restaurant ID and the KIOSK activation key, then tap Activate Kiosk.\n\nRestaurant ID\n\nJM9170317637\nCopy ID\nOpen customer kioskCopy link for the kiosk device\n\nOpen customer kiosk uses this device. If your touchscreen is a different device, copy the link and open it there before entering the key.\n\nInstall the kiosk app\n3. Check the connection\n\nAfter activation, the terminal appears below. You can keep this admin page open on your laptop.\n\n0 connected terminal records in this branch\n\nCheck for connected kiosksManage kiosk menu\n\nThe list refreshes automatically and when you return to this window. Check terminal health below before opening service.\n\nNo kiosks have been activated in this branch yet. Follow the steps above to connect your first terminal.\n\nJAMAN AI\nDisplay",
